@title Doom (USA, Europe)
@file Doom (U) [!].gba
@game ADME
@chip EEPROM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: no save before finishing a level. The pause menu has only OPTIONS / LOAD GAME / QUIT GAME and LOAD GAME lists four SLOT EMPTY, so the first write should come at the end of E1M1 (not reached). The level-skip cheat (pause, hold L+R, A B A A B B B A) jumps straight to E1M2 and writes nothing. Blocker for a frozen script: identical input leaves the player in different places on the three emulators (movement follows the game's rendered frame rate), so a route through E1M1 does not carry across emulators.
# New game, episode 1, "I'm too young to die", walk around the E1M1 start area,
# turn on the computer-map cheat (pause, hold L+R, B A A A A A A A) and look at the
# automap, walk east into the brown-floored room, fire once, pause.
# Notes: at f600 the logo is drawn more slowly on dingbat-bios (shorter stroke
# than on mgba/nba). In E1M1 the view after identical input differs from about
# f1758 on: the player is a little further forward on mgba, and by f2949 all three
# stand in clearly different places. In a second session (UP held 150 frames from the
# start, then pause) dingbat-bios and nba stood in the same place and mgba did not;
# after more walking along walls dingbat-bios and nba drifted apart too. The pause-menu cursor DOWN at f2624 (6-frame
# hold) was missed by mgba once (it opened OPTIONS while the others opened LOAD GAME).

[new]
wait 600
wait 300
checkpoint title window=30
press START
wait 90
checkpoint main_menu window=30
press A
wait 60
checkpoint episode window=30
press A
wait 60
press UP
wait 10
press UP
wait 10
press UP
wait 10
press UP
wait 10
checkpoint skill window=30
press A
wait 200
checkpoint e1m1_start window=30
press UP hold=60
press START
wait 40
press B
wait 30
press SELECT
wait 30
press START
wait 30
press SELECT
wait 30
press SELECT
wait 10
press UP hold=120
wait 10
press LEFT hold=30
wait 10
press UP hold=120
wait 10
press SELECT
wait 10
press SELECT
wait 10
press START
wait 30
hold L+R
wait 10
press L+R+B
wait 8
press L+R+A
wait 8
press L+R+A
wait 8
press L+R+A
wait 8
press L+R+A
wait 8
press L+R+A
wait 8
press L+R+A
wait 8
press L+R+A
wait 8
release
wait 30
press START
wait 30
press SELECT
wait 20
press SELECT
wait 10
press RIGHT hold=60
wait 10
press SELECT
wait 10
press L hold=40
wait 10
press RIGHT hold=40
press DOWN hold=30
wait 5
press SELECT
wait 10
press UP hold=150
wait 10
checkpoint e1m1_east_room window=30
press A
wait 30
press START
wait 40
checkpoint pause_menu window=30
press START
wait 30
